&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams="true"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and grow as a React developer while shipping customer‑facing features that reduce friction for thousands of banking customers.&lt;/strong&gt; In this role you will join the Chargeback team to implement and improve the micro‑frontend for disputing card transactions, learn modern frontend engineering practices, and ship production code under mentorship. You’ll gain hands‑on experience with React and TypeScript, testing, and component design while helping shape a dependable, compliant user flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
