&lt;li&gt;Build, improve, and maintain features and customer flows within our &lt;strong&gt;Chargeback micro-frontend&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop functional, stable, and well-tested frontend solutions that follow agreed designs, flows, and development guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with &lt;strong&gt;frontend and backend developers, UX, product, and QA&lt;/strong&gt; to turn requirements and designs into working solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate APIs in collaboration with backend developers and build your understanding of API design and the wider technical architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in &lt;strong&gt;code reviews&lt;/strong&gt;, use feedback to improve your work, and contribute to shared frontend standards and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;Chargeback domain&lt;/strong&gt;, including customer journeys, stakeholders, APIs, and third-party dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of your assigned tasks, proactively work through problems, and know when to involve or ask for support from teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously develop your frontend skills and gradually take greater ownership across the software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
