&lt;li&gt;Experience with or foundational knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and a motivation to deepen your frontend development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong &lt;strong&gt;learning mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: you actively seek feedback, learn from mistakes, and apply what you have learned to new situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You listen to different perspectives, ask questions, share your ideas, and enjoy solving problems as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
