&lt;li&gt;Experience designing data models and optimizing schemas for complex business domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large datasets and high-volume systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can mobilize engineering teams around a technical vision and lead execution across multiple initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes engineering best practices, coding standards, and development processes that improve quality and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems-thinking mindset with the ability to balance immediate business needs against long-term platform investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading complex technical initiatives without direct people management responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about mentoring engineers and fostering a culture of technical excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in music, technology, and building systems that directly support artists and creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
